Section: devel
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 3.9.2

Package: amdrocm-vision
Version: @VP_VER@
Maintainer: ROCm Engineering <rocm-support@amd.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: amdrocm-mivisionx (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocal (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-roccv (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocpydecode (>= @VP_VER@)
Description: AMD ROCm Computer Vision extension pack (runtime meta-package)
 Installs MIVisionX, rocAL, rocCV, and rocPyDecode runtime libraries.
 This is a convenience meta-package — it carries no files of its own.

Package: amdrocm-vision-sdk
Version: @VP_VER@
Maintainer: ROCm Engineering <rocm-support@amd.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: amdrocm-vision (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-mivisionx-devel (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocal-devel (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-roccv-devel (>= @VP_VER@)
Description: AMD ROCm Computer Vision SDK (development meta-package)
 Installs all vision library runtime components plus development headers
 and cmake configs. Use this to build applications against the vision stack.

Package: amdrocm-vision-tests
Version: @VP_VER@
Maintainer: ROCm Engineering <rocm-support@amd.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: amdrocm-vision-sdk (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-mivisionx-test (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocal-test (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-roccv-test (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocpydecode-test (>= @VP_VER@)
Description: AMD ROCm Computer Vision test suite meta-package
 Installs all vision library test suites and the SDK they depend on.
